Copyright: unknown
Comment: Tesseract OCR training data and a dump of tesseract's own parameter
 list.  Provenance unsettled: they arrived in 2021 from a tessdata/ directory,
 with no record of whether they were trained here or taken from elsewhere.
 .
 This matters more than for the other reference material, because
 debian/install ships data/ to /usr/share/pgpid/ — these two files are in
 the binary package.  Their licence needs establishing.
License: reference-material

